    "preamble": "Thangam vs The Commissioner on 12 March, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.1 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 12.03.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.1293 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)No.1327 of 2024 Thangam ... Petit Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Food and Safety Department, 5th Floor, 359, Anna Salai, Chennai 6. 2.The District Collector, Trichy District, Trichy. 3.The Designated Officer, Food and Safety Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy. ... Respo Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to c the records pertaining to the Impugned Order made in Na.Ka.No. 1/4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P(Md Thangam vs The Commissioner on 12 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/177897455/ 1 2601/F.S.D/Trichy/2023, dated Nil, issued on 29.11.2023 passed by t third respondent and to quash the same and consequently direct the respondent to remove lock and seal of the petitioner's grocery shop permit the petitioner to carry on the business in the same premises For Petitioner : Mr.N.Ananda Kumar For Respondents : Mr.D.Gandhi Raj Special Government Pleader Order",
